struct ml_v4_info { 
    char name[16];  
    ml_data_call_state_e state; 
    bool reconnect;  
    struct ml_v4_address_status addr;  
    struct ml_pkt_stats stats;  
}; 
IPV4 info struct.  
name: APN name 
state: IPV4 data call state 
reconnect: IPV4 re-dial flag 
addr: IPV4 address 
stats: IPV4 packet status 
